```

### 方案3：反向遍历
```cpp
std::vector<int> v;
v = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6};

for (auto it = v.rbegin(); it != v.rend();) {
    if (*it % 2 == 0) {
        it = decltype(it){v.erase(std::next(it).base())};
    } else {
        ++it;
    }
}
```

### 方案4：使用索引遍历
```cpp
